                   "Microsoft.VSTS.TCM.Steps":  "\u003csteps id=\"0\" last=\"11\"\u003e\u003cstep id=\"2\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Navigate to StudentDataViewer Application and Open it.\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Main window of the application should open with Student\u0027s data grid and 3 buttons (Add, Edit and Delete Students)\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"3\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click On Delete Button\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Delete Student Window should be opened with Empty Students Data grid, Yes and No button\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"4\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click on No button in the Delete Student Window\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Delete Student window should be closed.\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"5\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click on Student Data List drop down and select \"ALL\"\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;All students\u0027 details should be displayed in the students data grid below.\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"6\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click checkbox of the first student in the Students data table\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;The clicked checkbox should be checked. \u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"7\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click on the delete button\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Delete Student Window should be opened, and the details of the checked student should be shown in the table\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"8\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click Yes Button\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Delete Student Window should be closed.\u0026lt;BR/\u0026gt;The checked student details should be deleted from the data and should not be shown in the table in main window. \u0026lt;BR/\u0026gt;The deleted students mark should not be shown in the graph.\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"9\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click of Select All Checkbox at the header of the table\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Check box of all the students in the table should be checked.\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"10\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click delete button\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Delete Student window should be shown with the details of all the students.\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003cstep id=\"11\" type=\"ValidateStep\"\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;DIV\u0026gt;\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Click Yes button\u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/DIV\u0026gt;\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cparameterizedString isformatted=\"true\"\u003e\u0026lt;P\u0026gt;Delete student window should be closed.\u0026lt;BR/\u0026gt;All the students should be deleted from the list is not shown in main window table. \u0026lt;/P\u0026gt;The deleted students mark should not be shown in the graph.\u003c/parameterizedString\u003e\u003cdescription/\u003e\u003c/step\u003e\u003c/steps\u003e"
